# Project Specifications & Scope Limits
- Target Repository Name: win32-ipc-window-compositor-thesis
- Proposed Title: Design and Implementation of a Window-Parenting Compositor Subsystem Using Win32 Hooking and Shared-Memory Inter-Process Communication (IPC)
